cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use InSituPy in your work, please cite the publication below."
title: "InSituPy"
abstract: >-
  InSituPy is a framework for histology-guided, multi-sample analysis of single-cell spatial
  omics data. Its hierarchical data structure organizes all data modalities per sample and links
  them to their metadata, from the multi-sample level down to the cellular and subcellular level.
